ocal AI2-PC with maker concurrency exactly one and complete-question page-chain context. It preserves write-once maker checkpoints and raw-response custody, including 216 maker-complete rows and two fail-closed safe rejections. Candidate-blind primary verification covers 218/218 questions, independent source-only high-risk second reads cover 156/156, and disagreements were assigned across three disjoint complete-paper resolver shards.\n\nTerminal conservation is exact: 218 = 196 resolver_verified + 20 verified_agreement + 2 safe_rejection, with 216 rows entering artifact-only staging. The additive resolver evidence dialect adapter is byte-preserving and accepts only schema-valid, source/packet/hash-bound terminal evidence; it also preserves the independently audited shard-01 v2 custody supersession without rewriting the original records or v1 terminal. There are zero false accepts, false overrides, unresolved conflicts, repeated terminal calls, provider calls during checking/resolution, or semantic/KG/canonical/production/public/downstream writes.\n\nVerification performed:\n\n- `PYTHONPATH=. python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1672_structural_batch_006.test.py` — 5 passed\n- `PYTHONPATH=. python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1672_resolution.test.py` — 5 passed\n- `PYTHONPATH=. python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1670_structural_batch_005.test.py` — 5 passed\n- `PYTHONPATH=. python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1670_resolution.test.py` — 8 passed\n- `PYTHONPATH=. python3 scripts/vlm/issue_1672_finalize_resolution.py publish-final-evidence` — byte-identical replay PASS\n- `python3 -m py_compile` for the Batch006 production/reconciliation/finalization scripts — PASS\n- `git diff --check` — PASS\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` — healthy gates; only expected pre-push upstream warning\n\nKey receipts:\n\n- artifact manifest SHA-256: `3d633209bc2a612b0a952db30fc1dbcd0c1c1ffbb865d3717293ff7c775d8560`\n- deterministic reconstruction SHA-256: `9987b172c14f2c3d63f89ef75a0f6e424fd4bfa2d492940b5fd50e30d6255204`\n- verification ledger SHA-256: `6f09ef9ff18c20dd7abb445ad01727d3fb34b87c36e04c13b4fc65728ebd6337`\n- verified staging SHA-256: `b80ea8e7be6bd390a5798abcc0f237bf551a66d172d8088c8f3cca77d5461568`\n","created_at":"2026-07-22T19:51:50Z","updated_at":"2026-07-22T20:00:21Z","closed_at":"2026-07-22T20:00:21Z","merged_at":"2026-07-22T20:00:21Z","merge_commit_sha":"920b6f100dbc1b0a4601044b8ed513383750af2c","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1673/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1673/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1673/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/e705a2801cd4815501a32d86616e66819603c84e","head":{"label":"Samsen879:task/1672-9709-full-corpus-structural-production-batch-006","ref":"task/1672-9709-full-corpus-structural-production-batch-006","sha":"e705a2801cd4815501a32d86616e66819603c84e","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos"